  "cues": [
    {
      "shot_id": "S001",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "快点！今天最后一场，迟到一分钟都不行！",
      "start_s": 2.51,
      "end_s": 6.38,
      "planned_start_s": 0.0,
      "planned_end_s": 8.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 2.51,
      "film_end_s": 6.38,
      "asr_match_score": 0.986
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S001",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "电影又不会跑。以前让你上学，你怎么没这么积极？",
      "start_s": 6.46,
      "end_s": 12.34,
      "planned_start_s": 0.0,
      "planned_end_s": 8.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 6.46,
      "film_end_s": 12.34,
      "asr_match_score": 0.986
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S002",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "因为以前你不会明天就走。",
      "start_s": 4.42,
      "end_s": 7.15,
      "planned_start_s": 8.0,
      "planned_end_s": 15.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 12.42,
      "film_end_s": 15.15,
      "asr_match_score": 0.986
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S003",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "别把那个弄丢了！",
      "start_s": 1.86,
      "end_s": 3.63,
      "planned_start_s": 15.0,
      "planned_end_s": 23.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 16.86,
      "film_end_s": 18.63,
      "asr_match_score": 0.986
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S003",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "里面什么东西，比你哥还重要？",
      "start_s": 3.71,
      "end_s": 6.65,
      "planned_start_s": 15.0,
      "planned_end_s": 23.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 18.71,
      "film_end_s": 21.65,
      "asr_match_score": 0.986
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S003",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "到了再告诉你。",
      "start_s": 6.73,
      "end_s": 8.27,
      "planned_start_s": 15.0,
      "planned_end_s": 23.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 21.73,
      "film_end_s": 23.27,
      "asr_match_score": 0.986
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S004",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "正好，我也有东西没告诉你。",
      "start_s": 2.33,
      "end_s": 5.04,
      "planned_start_s": 23.0,
      "planned_end_s": 31.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 25.33,
      "film_end_s": 28.04,
      "asr_match_score": 0.987
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S004",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "那谁先说谁输。",
      "start_s": 5.12,
      "end_s": 7.28,
      "planned_start_s": 23.0,
      "planned_end_s": 31.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 28.12,
      "film_end_s": 30.28,
      "asr_match_score": 0.987
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S005",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "票呢？",
      "start_s": 4.33,
      "end_s": 5.06,
      "planned_start_s": 31.0,
      "planned_end_s": 39.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 35.33,
      "film_end_s": 36.06,
      "asr_match_score": 0.987
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S005",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "明明放这里了……",
      "start_s": 5.14,
      "end_s": 7.44,
      "planned_start_s": 31.0,
      "planned_end_s": 39.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 36.14,
      "film_end_s": 38.44,
      "asr_match_score": 0.987
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S006",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "最后一场哦。",
      "start_s": 2.05,
      "end_s": 3.08,
      "planned_start_s": 39.0,
      "planned_end_s": 46.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 41.05,
      "film_end_s": 42.08,
      "asr_match_score": 0.987
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S006",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "你别站着啊，帮我找！",
      "start_s": 3.16,
      "end_s": 5.11,
      "planned_start_s": 39.0,
      "planned_end_s": 46.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 42.16,
      "film_end_s": 44.11,
      "asr_match_score": 0.987
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S007",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "你兜里是什么？",
      "start_s": 3.94,
      "end_s": 5.41,
      "planned_start_s": 46.0,
      "planned_end_s": 54.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 49.94,
      "film_end_s": 51.41,
      "asr_match_score": 0.984
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S007",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "找了五分钟，原来你才是小偷。",
      "start_s": 5.49,
      "end_s": 7.59,
      "planned_start_s": 46.0,
      "planned_end_s": 54.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 51.49,
      "film_end_s": 53.59,
      "asr_match_score": 0.984
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S008",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "早上怕丢，我换地方了……忘了。",
      "start_s": 0.0,
      "end_s": 1.95,
      "planned_start_s": 54.0,
      "planned_end_s": 61.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 53.67,
      "film_end_s": 55.95,
      "asr_match_score": 0.984
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S008",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "你这记性，以后我不在，看你怎么办。",
      "start_s": 2.03,
      "end_s": 5.53,
      "planned_start_s": 54.0,
      "planned_end_s": 61.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 56.03,
      "film_end_s": 59.53,
      "asr_match_score": 0.984
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S008",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "所以才要赶上今天。",
      "start_s": 5.61,
      "end_s": 7.2,
      "planned_start_s": 54.0,
      "planned_end_s": 61.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 59.61,
      "film_end_s": 61.2,
      "asr_match_score": 0.984
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S009",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "本来准备电影结束再给你。",
      "start_s": 3.6,
      "end_s": 5.64,
      "planned_start_s": 61.0,
      "planned_end_s": 69.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 64.6,
      "film_end_s": 66.64,
      "asr_match_score": 0.984
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S009",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "说好谁先说谁输。",
      "start_s": 5.97,
      "end_s": 7.89,
      "planned_start_s": 61.0,
      "planned_end_s": 69.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 66.97,
      "film_end_s": 68.89,
      "asr_match_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S009",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "行，那我也不说。",
      "start_s": 8.21,
      "end_s": 8.88,
      "planned_start_s": 61.0,
      "planned_end_s": 69.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 69.21,
      "film_end_s": 69.88,
      "asr_match_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S009",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "你真幼稚。",
      "start_s": 8.96,
      "end_s": 10.15,
      "planned_start_s": 61.0,
      "planned_end_s": 69.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 69.96,
      "film_end_s": 71.15,
      "asr_match_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S009",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "跟你学的。",
      "start_s": 10.52,
      "end_s": 11.32,
      "planned_start_s": 61.0,
      "planned_end_s": 69.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 71.52,
      "film_end_s": 72.32,
      "asr_match_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S010",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "别看了，下次还骑。",
      "start_s": 4.77,
      "end_s": 6.62,
      "planned_start_s": 69.0,
      "planned_end_s": 74.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 73.77,
      "film_end_s": 75.62,
      "asr_match_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S011",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "你先输了。",
      "start_s": 9.0,
      "end_s": 9.69,
      "planned_start_s": 74.0,
      "planned_end_s": 82.0,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 83.0,
      "film_end_s": 83.69,
      "asr_match_score": 0.842
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S012",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "今天让你一次。",
      "start_s": 1.77,
      "end_s": 2.82,
      "planned_start_s": 82.0,
      "planned_end_s": 89.29,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 83.77,
      "film_end_s": 84.82,
      "asr_match_score": 0.842
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S013",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "你也带礼物了？",
      "start_s": 5.33,
      "end_s": 6.39,
      "planned_start_s": 89.29,
      "planned_end_s": 97.29,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 94.62,
      "film_end_s": 95.68,
      "asr_match_score": 0.923
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S013",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "所以我们打平。",
      "start_s": 7.06,
      "end_s": 8.02,
      "planned_start_s": 89.29,
      "planned_end_s": 97.29,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 96.35,
      "film_end_s": 97.31,
      "asr_match_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S013",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "我不是不回来了。我只是去读书。",
      "start_s": 9.16,
      "end_s": 10.6,
      "planned_start_s": 89.29,
      "planned_end_s": 97.29,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 98.45,
      "film_end_s": 99.89,
      "asr_match_score": 0.783
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S014",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "那很远。",
      "start_s": 2.68,
      "end_s": 3.28,
      "planned_start_s": 97.29,
      "planned_end_s": 104.39,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 99.97,
      "film_end_s": 100.57,
      "asr_match_score": 0.783
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S014",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "地图上远，不代表回不来。",
      "start_s": 3.63,
      "end_s": 5.54,
      "planned_start_s": 97.29,
      "planned_end_s": 104.39,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 100.92,
      "film_end_s": 102.83,
      "asr_match_score": 0.783
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S014",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "寒假第一天，还是这辆车。",
      "start_s": 5.62,
      "end_s": 8.49,
      "planned_start_s": 97.29,
      "planned_end_s": 104.39,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 102.91,
      "film_end_s": 105.78,
      "asr_match_score": 0.783
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S014",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "去哪？",
      "start_s": 8.88,
      "end_s": 9.48,
      "planned_start_s": 97.29,
      "planned_end_s": 104.39,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 106.17,
      "film_end_s": 106.77,
      "asr_match_score": 0.783
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S014",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "你定。",
      "start_s": 9.56,
      "end_s": 10.16,
      "planned_start_s": 97.29,
      "planned_end_s": 104.39,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 106.85,
      "film_end_s": 107.45,
      "asr_match_score": 0.783
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S015",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "那下次别骑这么近。",
      "start_s": 6.18,
      "end_s": 7.66,
      "planned_start_s": 104.39,
      "planned_end_s": 112.39,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 110.57,
      "film_end_s": 112.05,
      "asr_match_score": 0.783
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S015",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "行。",
      "start_s": 7.87,
      "end_s": 8.66,
      "planned_start_s": 104.39,
      "planned_end_s": 112.39,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 112.26,
      "film_end_s": 113.05,
      "asr_match_score": 0.783
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S015",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "骑到海的另一边。",
      "start_s": 9.08,
      "end_s": 10.28,
      "planned_start_s": 104.39,
      "planned_end_s": 112.39,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 113.47,
      "film_end_s": 114.67,
      "asr_match_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S015",
      "speaker_id": "C01",
      "text": "你先学会别把电影票忘在自己兜里。",
      "start_s": 11.23,
      "end_s": 11.83,
      "planned_start_s": 104.39,
      "planned_end_s": 112.39,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 115.62,
      "film_end_s": 116.22,
      "asr_match_score": 0.595
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S016",
      "speaker_id": "C02",
      "text": "哥。",
      "start_s": 3.91,
      "end_s": 4.51,
      "planned_start_s": 112.39,
      "planned_end_s": 119.49,
      "timing_source": "asr_sensevoice_vad",
      "film_start_s": 116.3,
